// A symlink at the plate path is not the plate.
// The read ignores it. The write replaces the link.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE nofollow ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law     ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG nofollow law

IMPULSE nofollow 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "nofollow" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
